Suite 900, Charlotte, North Carolina 28209. Unless the context otherwise indicates, the terms \"Albemarle,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our\" or \"the Company\" mean Albemarle Corporation and its consolidated subsidiaries.","zh":"Albemarle Corporation 於 1993 年在維吉尼亞州註冊成立。我們主要的執行辦公室位於 4250 Congress Street, Suite 900, Charlotte, North Carolina 28209。除非上下文另有說明，術語「Albemarle」、「我們」、「我們的」或「本公司」均指 Albemarle Corporation 及其合併子公司。"},{"en":"Albemarle is a world leader in transforming essential resources into critical ingredients for mobility, energy, connectivity, and health. Our purpose is to enable a more resilient world. We partner to pioneer new ways to move, power, connect, and protect. The end markets we serve include grid storage, automotive, aerospace, conventional energy, electronics, construction, agriculture and food, pharmaceuticals and medical devices. We believe that our world-class resources with reliable and consistent supply, our leading process chemistry, high-impact innovation, customer centricity and focus on people and planet will enable us to maintain a leading position in the industries in which we operate.","zh":"雅保 (Albemarle) 是將重要資源轉化為交通、能源、連結性和健康的關鍵成分的世界領導者。我們的目標是打造一個更具彈性的世界。我們合作開拓新的行動、供電、連接和保護方式。我們服務的終端市場包括電網儲存、汽車、航空航太、常規能源、電子、建築、農業和食品、藥品和醫療設備。我們相信，我們的世界級資源、可靠且穩定的供應、領先的工藝化學、高影響力的創新、以客戶為中心以及對人類和地球的關注將使我們能夠在我們經營的行業中保持領先地位。"},{"en":"We and our joint ventures currently operate more than 25 production and research and development (\"R&D\") facilities, as well as a number of administrative and sales offices, around the world. As of December 31, 2025, we served approximately 1,900 customers in approximately 70 countries. For information regarding our unconsolidated joint ventures, see Note 8, \"Investments,\" to our consolidated financial statements included in Part II, Item 8 of this report.","zh":"我們和我們的合資企業目前在世界各地運營超過 25 個生產和研發 (“R&D”) 設施，以及多個行政和銷售辦事處。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們為約 70 個國家的約 1,900 名客戶提供服務。有關我們未合併合資企業的資訊，請參閱本報告第二部分第 8 項所載合併財務報表附註 8「投資」。"}],"markets":[{"en":"During 2025, we managed and reported our operations under three reportable segments: Energy Storage, Specialties and Ketjen. The segments are organized based on their similar markets, customers, economic characteristics and production processes. Financial results and discussion about our segments included in this report are organized according to these categories except where noted.","zh":"2025 年，我們在三個可報告部門下管理和報告我們的營運：能源儲存、特殊產品和 Ketjen。這些細分市場是根據相似的市場、客戶、經濟特徵和生產流程進行組織的。除非另有說明，本報告中包含的財務業績和有關我們部門的討論是根據這些類別進行組織的。"},{"en":"On October 25, 2025, the Company signed a definitive agreement to divest the controlling ownership interest of Ketjen's Refining Solutions business to ChemCat AcquisitionCo, LLC and contribute the remaining ownership interest to ChemCat Holdings, LP, a newly formed limited partnership (\"Holdco\"). The Refining Solutions business being divested and contributed is defined as the Company's Ketjen reportable segment, excluding its PCS business and the Company's 50% ownership interest in Eurecat S.A. In a separate transaction, on January 23, 2026, the Company completed the sale of its 50% ownership interest in Eurecat S.A., a joint venture included in the Ketjen segment, to Axens SA. Following the completion of these transactions, the Company will retain the PCS business and common units of Holdco initially representing a 49% interest. We expect the Refining Solutions transaction to be complet","zh":"2025 年 10 月 25 日，公司簽署了一份最終協議，將 Ketjen 煉油解決方案業務的控股權益剝離給 ChemCat AcquisitionCo, LLC，並將剩餘所有權權益捐贈給新成立的有限合夥企業 ChemCat Holdings, LP（「Holdco」）。被剝離和貢獻的煉油解決方案業務被定義為公司的 Ketjen 可報告部門，不包括其 PCS 業務和公司在 Eurecat S.A. 的 50% 所有權。在 2026 年 1 月 23 日的另一筆交易中，公司完成了將其在 Eurecat S.A.（屬於 Ketjen 部門的合資企業）的 50% 所有權出售給 Axens SA。這些交易完成後，公司將保留 PCS 業務和 Holdco 的普通單位，最初持有 49% 的權益。我们预计炼油解决方案交易将完成"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The global lithium market is highly competitive and growing very rapidly. It is characterized by aggressive expansion and entry from existing and new players, including automotive OEMs, commodity traders, junior miners, and large, well-capitalized diversified miners. Producers are primarily located in the Americas, Africa, Asia and Australia. Major competitors in lithium compounds include Sociedad Quimica y Minera de Chile S.A., Sichuan Tianqi Lithium, Jiangxi Ganfeng Lithium, Rio Tinto plc, Pilbara Minerals, Tesla and a large number of additional Chinese companies. Competition in the global lithium market is increasingly based on index-based market pricing and differentiated via product quality, product diversity, reliability of supply and customer service.","zh":"全球鋰市場競爭激烈且成長非常迅速。其特點是現有和新參與者的積極擴張和進入，包括汽車原始設備製造商、大宗商品貿易商、初級礦商以及資本充足的大型多元化礦商。生產商主要位於美洲、非洲、亞洲和澳洲。鋰化合物的主要競爭對手包括智利Sociedad Quimica y Minera de Chile S.A.、四川天齊鋰業、江西贛鋒鋰業、力拓集團、皮爾巴拉礦業公司、特斯拉以及大量其他中國公司。全球鋰市場的競爭越來越基於基於指數的市場定價，並透過產品品質、產品多樣性、供應可靠性和客戶服務進行差異化。"},{"en":"We obtain lithium: (a) by purchasing lithium concentrate from our 49%-owned joint venture, Windfield Holdings Pty. Ltd. (\"Windfield\"), which directly owns 100% of the equity of Talison Lithium Pty. Ltd., a company incorporated in Australia (\"Talison\") that owns the Greenbushes mine, and from our 50%-owned unincorporated joint venture, MARBL Lithium Joint Venture (\"MARBL\") in Western Australia, which owns the Wodgina hard rock lithium mine project (\"Wodgina\"); and (b) through solar evaporation of our ponds at the Salar de Atacama, in Chile, and in Silver Peak, Nevada. In addition, we hold mineral rights in defined areas of Kings Mountain, North Carolina with available lithium resources and we own undeveloped land with access to a lithium resource in Antofalla, within the Catamarca Province of Argentina. See Item 2. Properties, for additional disclosures of our lithium mineral properties.","zh":"我們透過以下方式取得鋰：(a) 透過從我們持股 49% 的合資企業 Windfield Holdings Pty. Ltd.（「Windfield」）和我們持股 50% 的非法人合資企業 MARBL Lithium Joint Venture（「MARBL」）購買鋰精礦，Windfield Holdings Pty. Ltd. 直接擁有 Talium 10% 的澳洲礦場，Windfield Holdings Pty. Ltd。的股權。位於西澳大利亞州，擁有Wodgina硬岩鋰礦計畫（“Wodgina”）； (b) 透過智利阿塔卡馬鹽沼和內華達州銀峰池塘的太陽蒸發。此外，我們還擁有北卡羅來納州國王山特定地區的礦權，擁有可用的鋰資源，並且我們在阿根廷卡塔馬卡省的安託法拉擁有未開發的土地，可以獲得鋰資源。有關我們的鋰礦物特性的更多揭露，請參閱第 2 項「特性」。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Energy Storage","val":2710035000,"zh":"儲能"},{"name":"Specialties","val":1366435000,"zh":"特產"},{"name":"Ketjen","val":1066263000,"zh":"科特延"}],"total":5142733000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"CN","val":2026293000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Other Foreign Countries","val":1076764000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"US","val":890498000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"KR","val":789547000,"zh":"韓國"},{"name":"JP","val":359631000,"zh":"日本"}],"total":5142733000}},"peers":["SQM","LAC","FMC","ENPH","NEE"]}}